      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "Studies were eligible for inclusion if they (i) were original research articles, cohort studies, or case reports; (ii) focused on AI-driven tools used for assessing or improving mental health outcomes; and (iii) were published between 2000 and 2024.",
      "reason": "Eligible designs and topic focus are specified, but settings, populations, and follow-up requirements are not defined as eligibility criteria."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_5",
      "quote": "Studies were excluded if they ... (iii) lacked full-text availability; or (iv) were not published in English.",
      "reason": "Publication year range (2000-2024), English language requirement, and full-text availability (publication status) are specified."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_5_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": "text_10",
      "quote": "Articles were ... excluded if they contained missing or incomplete data, lacked AI-specific interventions, or failed to report on mental health",
